\" data-user_id=\"218982\" data-register_action=\"follow_user\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_plus on_follow\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><line x1=\"20\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"20\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"23\" y1=\"11\" x2=\"17\" y2=\"11\"></line></svg><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_user_check on_unfollow\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"8.5\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><polyline points=\"17 11 19 13 23 9\"></polyline></svg><span class=\"on_follow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Follow mrdrnose</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Follow</span></span><span class=\"on_unfollow\"><span class=\"full_label\">Following mrdrnose</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Following</span></span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/login?return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fmrdrnose.itch.io%2Fvotv&amp;intent=add_to_collection\" class=\"action_btn add_to_collection_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_collection_add2\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M 1,6 H 14\" /><path d=\"M 1,11 H 14\" /><path d=\"m 1,16 h 9\" /><path d=\"M 18,11 V 21\" /><path d=\"M 13,16 H 23\" /></svg><span class=\"full_label\">Add To Collection</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Collection</span></a></li><li class=\"community_link\"><a href=\"https://mrdrnose.itch.io/votv/community\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_comment\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\" /></svg>Community</a></li><li class=\"devlog_link\"><a href=\"https://mrdrnose.itch.io/votv/devlog\" class=\"action_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_news\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"3\" width=\"22\" height=\"18\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"8\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"16\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"16\"></line></svg>Devlog</a></li><li><a href=\"https://itch.io/games-like/1635465/votv\" target=\"_blank\" data-label=\"related_btn\" class=\"action_btn related_games_btn\"><svg stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_map\" aria-hidden width=\"18\" height=\"18\" role=\"img\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><polygon points=\"1 6 1 22 8 18 16 22 23 18 23 2 16 6 8 2 1 6\"></polygon><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"2\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"18\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"16\" y2=\"22\"></line></svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_share-tech-mono\"><div class=\"header align_center has_image\" id=\"header\"><img alt=\"&quot;Voices Of The Void&quot; Alpha\" src=\"https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI2NDI5MDU2LmpwZw==/original/tdJM14.jpg\"/><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">&quot;Voices Of The Void&quot; Alpha</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget buy_on_top\" id=\"view_game_9742915\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"buy_row\"><div class=\"button_message\"><a href=\"https://mrdrnose.itch.io/votv/purchase\" class=\"button buy_btn\">Download Now</a><span class=\"buy_message\"><span class=\"sub\">Name your own price</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>You work as a scientist in the isolated research lab in the mountains  of Switzerland. Your task is to gather signals from space, analyze  them, process them and sell them to get points.\r\n    </p>\r\n<p>You can get regular signals and objects like dwarf planets and stars,  or you can get something &quot;unusual&quot; or even &quot;strange&quot; and  &quot;unexplainable&quot;.\r\n    </p>\r\n<p>The game has 45+ days and unique events, 200+ unique signals, plenty of secrets, mysteries and easter eggs.\r\n    </p>\r\n<p>You can report problems and give ideas\\suggestions on <a href=\"https://discord.gg/WKBvqu4tjV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Discord Server</a>\r\n<br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3>WARNING</h3>\r\n<p>If you having trouble accessing to Story mode - go to tutorial, wait for Achievement pop up, go to settings, apply settings.</p>\r\n<p>NOTE:</p>\r\n<p>Since the game started to use 7z format, you gotta download the 7zip archiver.<br>Get 7zip <strong><a href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">&gt;&gt;&gt;here&lt;&lt;&lt;<br></a></strong></p>\r\n<p><strong><a href=\"https://www.7-zip.org/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"></a></strong><br></p>\r\n<h3>Afterword</h3>\r\n<p>This game is an &quot;Alpha&quot; that means it is far from perfect, but it has quite a lot of stuff to play with and to look at. It has a basic gameplay loop, plenty of different mechanics, gameplay elements, stuff to play around with etc<br>You can support the game on <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/eternitydev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Patreon</a> and give it more chances to get into release state.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3>Quick FAQ</h3>\r\n<p><strong><em>Q: </em></strong>Will there be a multiplayer in the future?<em><br></em><strong><em>A: </em></strong>No, due to the lack of networking experience and lack of foundation for net in the game.<em><br></em></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>Q: </em></strong>Why game uses so much resources?<em><br></em><strong><em>A: </em></strong>This might be caused by &quot;Volumetric Light&quot; setting, disable it and it should be better. Also you can lower the shadows, effects, draw distance, but setting shadows to 0 is not recommended if you want a decent picture.<br></p>\r\n<p><strong><em>Q: </em></strong>How to use custom content (pictures, radio, tv etc)<em><br></em><strong><em>A: </em></strong>There are entries for these in Help section in main\\pause menu, but the asset folder is located at &quot;appdata\\local\\votv\\assets&quot;. If you can&#x27;t see the folder - run your game As Administrator and it will generate the folder.</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Q: </strong></em>All my settings are at 0; Quality is super pixelated; Completely black\\gray screen<em><br></em><strong><em>A: </em></strong>Go to Settings&gt;Game and click &quot;Regenerate data.sav&quot; button</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Q: </strong></em>I don&#x27;t understand X thing<br><strong><em>A: </em></strong>Go to main menu/pause menu and open click &quot;Help&quot; button to open Help window, you can look up the issue you&#x27;re having a problem with.</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>Q: </strong></em>Will the game be on Steam one day?<br><strong><em>A: </em></strong>The game will get in Steam eventually, but the game is still quite unfinished so it will take some time to polish it for Steam release.</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<h3>Links</h3>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/eternitydev\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Patreon</a> <br></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WKBvqu4tjV\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Discord Server</a>\r\n </p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.donationalerts.com/r/mrdrnose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Donation Alerts</a>\r\n </p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://twitter.com/MrDrNose1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Twitter</a>\r\n <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCthmkgnVs7mohAakF4ucjlQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\"><br></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCthmkgnVs7mohAakF4ucjlQ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">YouTube<br></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://boosty.to/mrdrnose\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Boosty<br></a></p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://votv.dev/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Official Website [WIP]</a></p>\r\n<p><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://archive.votv.dev/games/votv/\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">VotV builds Official Archive</a>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://forms.gle/LnbTkm8DBPPN7uaY8\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" referrerpolicy=\"origin\">Bug Report Form</a><br></p>\r\n<p>Contact email for business/urgent/refunds: <strong>devs@votv.dev</strong><br><em>(we don&#x27;t take publisher offers at the moment)</em></p>\r\n<p><br><br></p>\r\n<h3>ATTENTION</h3>\r\n<p>Don&#x27;t post major spoilers\\uncensored spoilers in the comment section. These messages will be deleted.       </p>\r\n<p><strong>[&quot;Funy&quot; comments\\memes regarding the update will be deleted or banned]</strong>  \r\n</p>\r\n<p><br></p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"j